M('a','k',"What should a Node server do on SIGTERM for a graceful shutdown?","Stop accepting new connections, finish in-flight requests, close resources, then exit","Exit immediately","Ignore the signal","Restart itself","Graceful shutdown avoids dropped requests during deployments.")
